rmc-loadout-group-commanding-officer-career = Commanding Officer (Career Profile)
rmc-loadout-group-commanding-officer-affiliation = Commanding Officer (Affiliation)

ent-RMCCOCareerInfantryPreview = Infantry
    .desc = A line-command background. Starts with combat-ready clothing, webbing, sunglasses, and a laser designator.
ent-RMCCOCareerEngineeringPreview = Engineering
    .desc = An engineering background. Starts with insulated gloves, tool webbing, an engineering beret, and a utility vest.
ent-RMCCOCareerMedicalPreview = Medical
    .desc = A medical background. Starts with a white Major beret, patchless officer jacket, and white gloves and shoes.
ent-RMCCOCareerIntelPreview = Intelligence
    .desc = An intelligence background. Starts in a subdued formal uniform with a tactical wrap and utility vest.
ent-RMCCOCareerLogisticsPreview = Logistics
    .desc = A logistics background. Starts with insulated gloves, tool webbing, a tan beret, and a tan vest.
ent-RMCCOCareerAviationPreview = Aviation
    .desc = An aviation background. Starts with a pilot jacket, aviators, and a black commanding officer beret.
ent-RMCCOCareerTankerPreview = Tanker
    .desc = An armored-operations background. Starts in an operations uniform with a windbreaker and tactical wrap.

ent-RMCCoatCOPatchless = commanding officer's jacket
    .desc = A patchless version of the officer jacket; its presence is still domineering.

ent-RMCCOAffiliationUnalignedPreview = Unaligned
    .desc = A balanced command philosophy without a fixed political bloc. Briefings emphasize standard mission priorities.
ent-RMCCOAffiliationHawksPreview = Hawks
    .desc = An aggressive command philosophy focused on hostile containment, decisive action, and force protection.
ent-RMCCOAffiliationDovesPreview = Doves
    .desc = A humanitarian command philosophy focused on rescue, restraint, and minimizing collateral damage.
ent-RMCCOAffiliationMagpiesPreview = Magpies
    .desc = A technical command philosophy focused on recovering research, data, samples, and strategic equipment.
